Text Notes 800 4200 0 75 ~ 0
U4 states (Q1,Q2): 00 -> 10 -> 11 -> 01 -> 00. MIDLOW rises 250 ns before PHI2.
Text Notes 800 10000 0 75 ~ 0
U5A synchronizes REQ; U5B is the second stage; U6A delays that state by 1 us.
Text Notes 800 10300 0 75 ~ 0
CS0_N is Low for exactly 1 PHI2 period per REQ rising edge. Hold address/data until the transaction ends.
Text Notes 800 10600 0 75 ~ 0
REQ >=10 us High and >=10 us Low; change LOGIC_CLR_N only with BUS_EN=0. See timing analysis in documentation.
$EndSCHEMATC
